text:
AI (DALL-E by OpenAI: ChatGPT) was used to:
- generate the game logo;
- generate textures for physical materials (rocks, wood, etc.);
- generate shields, bushes, flags, gold chains, mosaics, and a sword;
- generate dynamite, rods, enemies, and bonuses;
This game does not use AI to live-generate content or code during gameplay.
All AI assets have undergone human post-processing.
